{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1759681584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1759681584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1759681584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... with a weird flower fairy?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy simulation game where you run a magical flower shop with the help (and occasional chaos) of a clueless fairy. Run a flower shop, arrange unique bouquets, and build connections with the quirky townsfolk who wander through your doors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2019s requests with your own floral designs using unique combinations of flowers and decorations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wholesome Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a silly, light-hearted, and relatable tale of self-discovery of Puni.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Floriography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete flower collections and uncover the language of flowers through your scrapbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop your own with cute, customizable decor and personal touches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the Townsfolks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a quirky cast of characters, uncover their stories, and form lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396290?t=1759681584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/f3a8b474d4628ef649c219c20eff33aedd8ae918/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759681584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/e475525b5a9a5130960bb09c7a5e0a2d2d0d09fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759681584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/e475525b5a9a5130960bb09c7a5e0a2d2d0d09fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759681584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.poster.avif?t=1759681584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.webm?t=1759681584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/extras/21a6f3a60c125235172f3ce0b9b71cf5.mp4?t=1759681584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage a flower shop, design bouquets... with a weird flower fairy?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puni the Florist</strong> is a cozy simulation game where you run a magical flower shop with the help (and occasional chaos) of a clueless fairy. Run a flower shop, arrange unique bouquets, and build connections with the quirky townsfolk who wander through your doors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill townsfolk\u2019s requests with your own floral designs using unique combinations of flowers and decorations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wholesome Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a silly, light-hearted, and relatable tale of self-discovery of Puni.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn Floriography</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete flower collections and uncover the language of flowers through your scrapbook.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop your own with cute, customizable decor and personal touches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the Townsfolks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a quirky cast of characters, uncover their stories, and form lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Earthquack Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396290/b64ff04abeb299aa9e7e61de0eccc6014e5fdc2e/header.jpg?t=1759681584","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396290/1657846638/7d71ada768874bc4216508dbdcb8ec8a7d00a1ad/1759681231/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759681582","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396290/1657846638/7d71ada768874bc4216508dbdcb8ec8a7d00a1ad/1759681231/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759681582","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3396290/1657846638/7d71ada768874bc4216508dbdcb8ec8a7d00a1ad/1759681231/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759681582","id":257212627,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212627/movie480.mp4?t=1759681582","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212627/movie_max.mp4?t=1759681582"},"name":"Gameplay Tr